<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Small tournament starts today, Captain. Local boys, three evenings.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: At Kohliwada?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Yes. Think of it as practice with a scorecard. No big prizes, just some pocket money for the winners.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Who's playing?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: The usual lanes. Boys you know. Nothing fancy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: Good. I can focus on my shots without the noise.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Exactly. Use these matches to try things. That late cut you've been practicing? Test it today.

